# The ships of the AI (the script vehicles/vehiclesnpc.py of the game). Section Profile is SetAIProfile: the
# attributes each profile sets on the profile object $sp (a cShipAI of the script), the first match of $type wins as
# in the script, an unknown profile prints the console error of the script (run notfound). MercBase and Merc are the
# hired mercenaries by BadReputation ($rptn). ScrapYard, Normal, Medium and Heavy are the ship classes Init gives
# ShipMaker ($name a traffic model). A pack in mods/ with scrapc/vehicles/vehiclesnpc.def replaces this file.

section Profile
object $sp
StupidPathFinding 0
ControlStrafe 2
if $type == Rookie
	CadenceShootCM 7
	UsePercSonic 100
	UsePercCloud 0
	UsePercElectro 0
	UsePercHook 0
	FactorHookMap 1
	CadenceShoot 7
	ControlAim 1
	AngAttack 3.1415
	CounterAttack 0.0
	ControlBoost 0
	ControlBoostItemLife 0
	ControlBoostItemAmmo 0
	FactorDamageGetAway 0.2
	FactorDamageItemLife 0.15
	FactorItemAmmo 0.1
	ControlStrafeEvasion 0
	UsePercHookGetAway 0
	TimeMaxStrafe 2
	VelMaxStrafe 0.25
	LifeMult 1.0
